<resources>
    <!-- USB-C port > Off. GrapheneOS's first sentence says Off turns off the
         port. On the FP6 the ADSP firmware still runs Type-C and USB PD, so
         this names what Off turns off: USB data and the charger input. The
         second sentence is GrapheneOS's. GrapheneOS ships this text in
         English only, so there are no translations to replace. -->
    <string name="usbc_port_off_summary">Turns off USB data and charging on the USB-C port. Doesn’t impact the separate charging mode, which is activated by turning off the device and plugging it in to a charger.</string>
</resources>
